sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Candidate
    participant H as One host
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant AI as Local providers
    actor R as Reviewer
    C->>H: Login, prepare, start
    H->>P: Freeze questions and deadline
    C->>H: Save revision / verified recording
    H->>P: Accept draft
    C->>H: Submit
    H->>P: Atomic snapshot + outbox
    H-->>C: Durable receipt
    H->>K: Publish processing-intent IDs
    K->>H: Deliver metadata
    H->>P: Idempotent durable job
    H->>AI: Transcribe then score
    H->>P: Persist transcript then suggestion
    R->>H: Review criteria and publish
    H->>P: Final scores + audit
    C->>H: Read published feedback
